<!--
  Sitemap is intentionally short.

  The app is a hash-routed SPA, so model/bench/submission detail pages
  live at #model/<slug>, #bench/<slug>, etc. Search engines ignore
  fragment identifiers (#…), so listing every hash route would be
  noise. Google will crawl the SPA shell and surface the per-entity
  data via the JSON-LD on the homepage and the open-graph tags
  swapped in by the client.

  Real, separately-served URLs (the legal pages) ARE listed.
-->
